ull},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-11-10T18:16:01Z","updated_at":"2025-11-17T15:13:54Z","closed_at":"2025-11-14T21:25:14Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.4.1.stable.official [49a5bc7b6]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8097) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-14900HX (32 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen calling `AnimationPlayer::play()`, the animation doesn't actually advance until the next frame. Simple-looking spawning code like this will show one frame of the enemy (REST pose?) before the spawning animation takes over. \n\n```\n\tvar enemy = enemy_scene.instantiate()\n\tenemy.global_position = pos\n\tenemy.play(\"spawn\")\n\tadd_child(enemy)\n```\n\nYou can call `advance(0)` to force the animation player to correctly render the starting frame of it's current animation instantly. \n\nI am suggesting that in most cases, it's desirable for `play` to actually start playing the animation that frame, not defer it one frame. \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nReproduce as-above, or check my reproduction project. Reproduction project simply spawns a few enemies. The enemies on the left side of the screen use the 'advance' trick, while the ones on the right reproduce the original issue. \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[animationstartbug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23459868/animationstartbug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"SirLich","id":18729296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NzI5Mjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18729296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SirLich","html_url":"https://github.com/SirLich","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SirLich/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SirLich/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SirLich/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SirLich/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SirLich/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SirLich/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SirLich/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SirLich/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SirLich/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112612/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112612/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}